{"id":"n69521-4-8","stage":1,"title":"운동 · 运动","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69521-4-8-1","ko":"옛날 사람들은 시간을 어떻게 알았을까?","zh":"古代的人是怎么知道时间的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옛날","meaning":"古，古代","explanation":"옛날：古，古代","readings":[{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57273","senseId":"1","lemma":"옛날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알았을까?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"336963582ab921f0","term":"옛날","zh":"古，古代","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3","entryId":"57273","definition":"年代久远的往日。","pronunciation":["옌ː날"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad12f6946472d56d78e5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69521-4-8-2","ko":"별의 운동을 관찰하여 시간과 계절의 변화를 알았지.","zh":"他们通过观察星星的运行来了解时间和季节的变化。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"별의","meaning":"星星","explanation":"별：星星；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58366","senseId":"1","lemma":"별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"4","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관찰하여","meaning":"观察","explanation":"관찰하다：观察；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"관찰하다","audio":"/audio/1193f821bfa135da9a02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61535","senseId":"1","lemma":"관찰하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간과","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계절의","meaning":"季节，季","explanation":"계절：季节，季；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"계절","audio":"/audio/de3d981ff9b0dab8c5c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22537","senseId":"1","lemma":"계절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변화를","meaning":"变化","explanation":"변화：变化；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"변화","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83169","senseId":"1","lemma":"변화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알았지.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ae3fc36d3a72017f","term":"별","zh":"星星","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3","entryId":"58366","definition":"夜空中闪闪发光的、除了月亮以外的天体。","pronunciation":["별ː"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"物体随着时间的流逝做的某种活动或移动。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"1193f821bfa135da","term":"관찰하다","zh":"观察","audio":"/audio/1193f821bfa135da9a02.mp3","entryId":"61535","definition":"深入仔细地察看事物或现象。","pronunciation":["관찰하다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"de3d981ff9b0dab8","term":"계절","zh":"季节，季","audio":"/audio/de3d981ff9b0dab8c5c4.mp3","entryId":"22537","definition":"根据自然现象将一年分为春、夏、秋、冬时的其中一部分。","pronunciation":["계ː절","게ː절"]},{"id":"d06231d77cebc3d0","term":"변화","zh":"变化","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3","entryId":"83169","definition":"某物的样子、状态或性质等变得不同。","pronunciation":["변ː화"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/edf8e7abf0e5f75a8694.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.04,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69521","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1373,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他们通过观察星星的运行来了解时间和季节的变化。","我打算寄信，邮票应该贴在哪儿呢？","古代的人是怎么知道时间的呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他们通过观察星星的运行来了解时间和季节的变化。","古代的人是怎么知道时间的呢？","我打算寄信，邮票应该贴在哪儿呢？"],"answer":0}]}
